"The Thorn family's new Chicago apartment was on the seventh floor, near a fire station."
"It had a den and kitchen split by a breakfast counter, and week-old carpet."
"The hall had brass number plates and emergency light strips."
"Alden's bedroom had a bookcase with animal stickers and an orange nightlight."
"Arjun Thomas tackled Body Drainer through the wall into the apartment and killed him there."
"Richard and Leah Thorn died when their bedroom was buried under debris from above."
"Hannah Elber stabilized the eighth floor by mistake instead of the seventh."
"A piece of table saw blade flew through the window and pierced eight-year-old Alden."
"The building across the street was an empty building being remodeled into apartments."
"A nightclub where Body Drainer began killing was a few blocks away."
"The building was later repaired and is still an apartment building."
